Bugfix: Turn the file list selection bar controls into buttons

The download and delete controls of the selection bar were anchors with an empty
href. They performed an action instead of navigating, so screen readers announced
a link that does not link, and without JavaScript the empty href reloaded the page
and moved focus to the top.

They are now buttons. The icon rules of the selection bar were qualified on the
anchor element, so the icons would have rendered zero pixels wide inside a button;
those rules now cover buttons as well, which also keeps the download spinner
working.

WCAG 2.1 AA, SC 2.4.4, SC 4.1.2
